    "title": "Nail Art Design Ideas",
    "description": "Get inspired and stay on trend with Nail Art Designs Ideas, the ultimate beauty app for all your nail art inspiration! \r\n\r\nWith a constantly updated gallery of thousands of manicure designs, including French manicures, simple nail designs, glitter and chrome, floral designs, geometric patterns, ombr\u00e9 and gradient, velvet nails, animal print, negative space, 3D designs, abstract art, and more. \r\n\r\nYou will never run out of nail art design ideas. Easily filter by nail color and download images to your phone for easy reference at the salon.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All images are copyright of their respective owners. All the images in this app are available on public domains. The images are not endorsed by any of the respective owners, and the images are used simply for aesthetic purposes. No copyright infringement is intended, and any request to remove one of the images will be honored. This application is an unofficial fan-based application. We always respect your creation.",
